*   "Terra-Thrummer" Bass Guitar: A 7-string extended-range bass, strung with thick, rusted wire, often played with a percussive slap-and-thump technique, heavily processed with octaver pedals and sub-harmonic exciters to achieve monumental, earth-shaking low frequencies.
